WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.295
What a comet is.

00:01.995 --> 00:06.975
A comet is mostly ice, coated with dark dust, a few kilometres across.

00:07.425 --> 00:11.994
Halley reflects only three parts in a hundred of the light that falls on it.

00:12.444 --> 00:22.674
As a comet nears the Sun its ice turns to gas, and sunlight and the solar wind blow gas and dust away from the Sun into a long, bright tail.
